1
00:00:20,380 --> 00:00:22,930
In the first year of the Hongxi reign
of the Ming dynasty,

2
00:00:22,930 --> 00:00:26,390
the emperor began considering
moving the capital to Jinling.

3
00:00:26,690 --> 00:00:29,500
But earthquakes had been
striking the city for days,

4
00:00:29,500 --> 00:00:31,630
leaving the people in a state of panic.

5
00:00:32,159 --> 00:00:34,800
Though reluctant,
Crown Prince Zhu Zhanji

6
00:00:35,080 --> 00:00:38,620
had no choice but to head south
at the emperor's command.

7
00:00:46,640 --> 00:00:47,500
Your Highness,

8
00:00:47,960 --> 00:00:49,560
Wang Ji, a merchant from Yangzhou,

9
00:00:49,560 --> 00:00:51,130
has presented you with a treasure ship.

10
00:00:51,130 --> 00:00:53,980
[Crown Prince, Zhu Zhanji]

11
00:00:55,130 --> 00:01:00,930
[The Crown Prince will arrive at Jinling
in three hours.]

12
00:01:01,200 --> 00:01:02,950
[Jinling City]

13
00:01:05,740 --> 00:01:08,130
[Wu Buping, Chief Constable
of Yingtian Prefecture]

14
00:01:11,590 --> 00:01:13,250
[Wu Dingyuan, Constable
of Yingtian Prefecture]

15
00:01:18,750 --> 00:01:19,230
Move!

16
00:01:19,780 --> 00:01:20,240
Hurry!

17
00:01:20,660 --> 00:01:21,660
Move, move, move!

18
00:01:23,920 --> 00:01:25,190
Hey, why are you stopping me?

19
00:01:25,190 --> 00:01:26,320
Go on, move to the back!

20
00:01:26,320 --> 00:01:27,720
Where am I supposed to go?

21
00:02:03,910 --> 00:02:04,910
Huliu explosive.

22
00:02:16,990 --> 00:02:17,670
Run!

23
00:02:18,490 --> 00:02:18,990
Father!

24
00:02:19,270 --> 00:02:19,870
Run!

25
00:02:20,490 --> 00:02:21,030
Hurry!

26
00:02:21,590 --> 00:02:22,450
Get out of here!

27
00:03:58,320 --> 00:04:02,260
[River of No Return]

28
00:04:02,300 --> 00:04:05,350
[Episode 1: Huliu explosive]

29
00:04:08,110 --> 00:04:09,550
Minister Shen, what do you think

30
00:04:09,550 --> 00:04:11,200
is the reason Father

31
00:04:11,780 --> 00:04:12,870
sent me to Jinling?

32
00:04:14,210 --> 00:04:15,070
Your Highness,

33
00:04:15,890 --> 00:04:17,390
Jinling has been
experiencing earthquakes for days.

34
00:04:17,390 --> 00:04:19,829
His Majesty has sent you there

35
00:04:20,230 --> 00:04:21,560
to reassure the people.

36
00:04:22,270 --> 00:04:22,960
Is that so?

37
00:04:23,320 --> 00:04:25,120
Father merely sent me to Jinling

38
00:04:25,590 --> 00:04:26,970
to sound out

39
00:04:27,180 --> 00:04:28,560
the court officials

40
00:04:28,650 --> 00:04:30,980
on how they feel
about moving the capital.

41
00:04:31,850 --> 00:04:33,500
What do you think the ministers' reaction

42
00:04:33,500 --> 00:04:34,820
will be?

43
00:04:35,120 --> 00:04:37,840
[Shen Lian, Official
of the Eastern Palace]

44
00:04:35,380 --> 00:04:36,030
I truly

45
00:04:37,340 --> 00:04:38,870
do not know, Your Highness.

46
00:04:39,440 --> 00:04:40,640
You truly do not know?

47
00:04:41,890 --> 00:04:43,350
Without canal transport,

48
00:04:43,610 --> 00:04:45,909
what will happen to all those
who depend on it for their livelihoods?

49
00:04:45,909 --> 00:04:48,909
Who will transport food and weapons
to the northern frontier?

50
00:04:48,909 --> 00:04:51,080
By now, everyone in the empire knows

51
00:04:51,650 --> 00:04:53,650
that Father and I disagree
on matters of state.

52
00:04:53,650 --> 00:04:54,970
I oppose moving the capital

53
00:04:54,970 --> 00:04:56,770
and have no wish to go to Jinling.

54
00:05:00,210 --> 00:05:01,390
Your Highness, please mind your words.

55
00:05:01,390 --> 00:05:03,450
Such things must never be said aloud.

56
00:05:05,460 --> 00:05:06,320
Your Highness,

57
00:05:06,520 --> 00:05:08,850
the treasure ship presented by Wang Ji,
a merchant from Yangzhou,

58
00:05:08,850 --> 00:05:10,850
has been following us all this time.

59
00:05:17,210 --> 00:05:18,210
Just look at this.

60
00:05:18,330 --> 00:05:20,550
The treasure ship presented to me
by the merchant

61
00:05:20,550 --> 00:05:22,710
is even grander
than the one Sanbao sailed on

62
00:05:22,710 --> 00:05:24,180
during his voyages to the Western Ocean.

63
00:05:24,180 --> 00:05:25,350
Your Highness must not accept this ship.

64
00:05:25,350 --> 00:05:26,590
Everything you see here

65
00:05:26,590 --> 00:05:29,050
was built with
the people's blood and sweat,

66
00:05:30,060 --> 00:05:33,920
extracted by Yangzhou's merchants
through ruthless exploitation.

67
00:05:36,580 --> 00:05:38,240
The people's blood and sweat?

68
00:05:42,030 --> 00:05:44,370
Minister Shen, I believe you are mistaken.

69
00:05:44,370 --> 00:05:46,100
Don't the functioning of the state

70
00:05:46,100 --> 00:05:47,500
and all its many expenses

71
00:05:47,500 --> 00:05:49,270
depend on the labor of the people?

72
00:05:49,270 --> 00:05:50,030
Besides,

73
00:05:50,440 --> 00:05:52,080
without goods being transported
by canal from south to north,

74
00:05:52,080 --> 00:05:53,610
how would the northern armies

75
00:05:53,610 --> 00:05:54,520
get their provisions, supplies,

76
00:05:54,520 --> 00:05:55,680
and weapons?

77
00:05:58,850 --> 00:06:00,410
But His Majesty issued an explicit decree.

78
00:06:00,410 --> 00:06:01,340
Which decree?

79
00:06:02,060 --> 00:06:04,180
The people must be given time
to recover and prosper.

80
00:06:04,180 --> 00:06:06,110
We must not wage war so frequently.

81
00:06:06,270 --> 00:06:08,150
Only when the people live
in peace and prosperity

82
00:06:08,150 --> 00:06:09,850
can a ruler earn a place
in the history books.

83
00:06:09,850 --> 00:06:10,440
Enough

84
00:06:11,850 --> 00:06:13,050
with your empty talk.

85
00:06:14,520 --> 00:06:15,390
Tell me,

86
00:06:16,650 --> 00:06:17,850
throughout history,

87
00:06:18,060 --> 00:06:19,850
which ruler earned lasting fame

88
00:06:19,850 --> 00:06:21,500
without expanding the realm

89
00:06:21,730 --> 00:06:23,710
and winning great military victories?

90
00:06:23,710 --> 00:06:24,580
Deliver my order:

91
00:06:24,580 --> 00:06:25,380
change ships.

92
00:06:29,580 --> 00:06:31,310
I'll sail on this treasure ship

93
00:06:31,460 --> 00:06:32,790
and prove it to the world

94
00:06:33,850 --> 00:06:35,330
that canal transport must continue,

95
00:06:35,330 --> 00:06:37,190
and the capital must not be moved.

96
00:06:53,530 --> 00:06:54,350
Father!

97
00:06:55,470 --> 00:06:56,390
Father!

98
00:06:58,940 --> 00:06:59,520
Father!

99
00:07:00,150 --> 00:07:01,610
Father! Are you all right?

100
00:07:02,000 --> 00:07:02,930
I'm pinned down.

101
00:07:02,960 --> 00:07:03,880
I can't get out!

102
00:07:06,390 --> 00:07:07,020
Father!

103
00:07:14,630 --> 00:07:15,160
Father.

104
00:07:15,770 --> 00:07:17,830
I thought you'd been blown to pieces!

105
00:07:19,650 --> 00:07:20,450
Constable Wu!

106
00:07:23,280 --> 00:07:24,080
Constable Wu.

107
00:07:24,140 --> 00:07:25,230
Take a head count.

108
00:07:25,500 --> 00:07:26,640
See if anyone's hurt or dead.

109
00:07:26,640 --> 00:07:27,320
Men,

110
00:07:27,640 --> 00:07:28,640
help the injured!

111
00:07:30,430 --> 00:07:31,650
I have to go to the palace.

112
00:07:31,650 --> 00:07:32,670
-Wait, Father.
-I want to go to the palace.

113
00:07:32,670 --> 00:07:33,159
Father,

114
00:07:34,150 --> 00:07:36,270
why are you going to the palace
at a time like this?

115
00:07:36,270 --> 00:07:38,680
Don't you understand
what an explosion like this means?

116
00:07:38,680 --> 00:07:40,030
Father, I do.

117
00:07:41,000 --> 00:07:42,260
It's Huliu explosive.

118
00:07:42,550 --> 00:07:43,930
Only the palace has it.

119
00:07:43,970 --> 00:07:45,470
Father, you can't go.

120
00:07:45,490 --> 00:07:46,870
-This is way beyond us.
-No.

121
00:07:46,870 --> 00:07:49,230
-We could lose our heads over this.
-No, no, no.

122
00:07:49,230 --> 00:07:51,080
-No, no, no.
I’ll be beheaded.

123
00:07:51,140 --> 00:07:54,470
I'll lose my head for sure if I don't
get to the bottom of this.

124
00:08:02,270 --> 00:08:03,270
Come on, get out.

125
00:08:07,330 --> 00:08:08,390
Come on, it's okay.

126
00:08:09,390 --> 00:08:10,120
Take it slow.

127
00:08:13,410 --> 00:08:13,960
Let's go.

128
00:08:14,120 --> 00:08:14,680
Careful.

129
00:08:17,700 --> 00:08:18,630
Watch your head.

130
00:08:33,090 --> 00:08:33,799
Watch out.

131
00:08:47,460 --> 00:08:48,440
Did you steal it?

132
00:08:49,040 --> 00:08:49,850
I didn't steal it!

133
00:08:49,850 --> 00:08:51,380
Are you going to talk or not?

134
00:08:51,730 --> 00:08:52,870
It wasn't me!

135
00:08:53,230 --> 00:08:54,280
It wasn't me!

136
00:08:54,960 --> 00:08:56,110
Are you going to talk or not?

137
00:08:56,110 --> 00:08:56,660
Are you going to talk or not?

138
00:08:56,660 --> 00:08:58,190
Are you going to talk or not?

139
00:08:59,510 --> 00:09:00,460
Are you going to talk or not?

140
00:09:00,460 --> 00:09:01,200
Constable Wu,

141
00:09:01,200 --> 00:09:02,440
didn't you have urgent business?

142
00:09:02,440 --> 00:09:03,130
Stop gawking

143
00:09:03,130 --> 00:09:03,930
and get going.

144
00:09:06,870 --> 00:09:07,600
Eunuch Qing,

145
00:09:07,820 --> 00:09:09,610
has something gone missing
from the palace lately?

146
00:09:09,610 --> 00:09:10,900
What's all this chaos about?

147
00:09:10,900 --> 00:09:12,560
It's been a mess for a long time.

148
00:09:12,560 --> 00:09:14,680
Ever since Emperor Taizong
moved the capital to Beijing,

149
00:09:14,680 --> 00:09:15,530
there's been no order

150
00:09:15,530 --> 00:09:16,310
in Jinling.

151
00:09:16,360 --> 00:09:17,890
And after the earthquakes,

152
00:09:18,090 --> 00:09:19,820
things have only gotten worse.

153
00:09:21,110 --> 00:09:22,110
Spare me, Eunuch!

154
00:09:22,110 --> 00:09:23,990
The earthquake caused
the warehouse to collapse,

155
00:09:23,990 --> 00:09:25,710
and the thieves took advantage
of the chaos.

156
00:09:25,710 --> 00:09:27,060
It really was a natural disaster, Eunuch!

157
00:09:27,060 --> 00:09:28,580
Please investigate this fairly, Eunuch!

158
00:09:28,580 --> 00:09:29,560
You call this

159
00:09:29,870 --> 00:09:31,580
a collapse caused by the earthquake?

160
00:09:31,580 --> 00:09:33,280
All you do is lie. Come here.

161
00:09:34,210 --> 00:09:35,810
Twist his tongue into a rope!

162
00:09:36,090 --> 00:09:36,630
Come with me!

163
00:09:36,630 --> 00:09:37,630
Eunuch, I...

164
00:09:39,080 --> 00:09:39,590
Move!

165
00:09:42,210 --> 00:09:42,680
Lord Zheng,

166
00:09:42,680 --> 00:09:45,110
Wu Buping, chief constable of the three
divisions of Yingtian Prefecture, is here.

167
00:09:45,110 --> 00:09:47,310
[Zheng He, Eunuch in Charge of Defense]

168
00:09:46,210 --> 00:09:47,990
The Huliu explosive
must be inspected daily,

169
00:09:47,990 --> 00:09:49,920
and two sixth-rank officials

170
00:09:49,920 --> 00:09:51,730
must review the ledgers together.

171
00:09:51,730 --> 00:09:55,330
Then two clerks must open the crates
and inspect their contents.

172
00:09:56,250 --> 00:09:59,080
These were the rules laid down
by Emperor Taizong.

173
00:09:59,280 --> 00:10:00,080
How could...

174
00:10:00,100 --> 00:10:01,300
-Eunuch Zheng.
-Yes.

175
00:10:01,370 --> 00:10:03,680
When Emperor Taizong
established those rules,

176
00:10:03,680 --> 00:10:05,340
Jinling was still the capital.

177
00:10:05,340 --> 00:10:06,920
These days, we should be grateful

178
00:10:06,920 --> 00:10:07,610
if inspections happen
once every five days.

179
00:10:07,610 --> 00:10:08,340
How dare you!

180
00:10:09,160 --> 00:10:09,940
Eunuch Zheng asked you a question.

181
00:10:09,940 --> 00:10:10,870
Answer him honestly.

182
00:10:10,870 --> 00:10:11,200
Yes.

183
00:10:11,230 --> 00:10:12,580
How dare you make
such presumptuous remarks?

184
00:10:12,580 --> 00:10:13,680
So you're

185
00:10:14,200 --> 00:10:15,840
Wu Buping, the Iron Lion?

186
00:10:16,020 --> 00:10:16,680
Lord Zheng,

187
00:10:17,160 --> 00:10:18,040
I've heard

188
00:10:18,640 --> 00:10:21,260
there's no case in Jinling
you can't crack.

189
00:10:21,540 --> 00:10:22,280
Lord Zheng,

190
00:10:22,300 --> 00:10:23,730
that's just my colleagues
at the prefectural office

191
00:10:23,730 --> 00:10:24,730
talking nonsense.

192
00:10:24,730 --> 00:10:25,780
You shouldn't take it seriously.

193
00:10:25,780 --> 00:10:26,760
Get to the point.

194
00:10:27,850 --> 00:10:28,770
Two hours earlier,

195
00:10:28,770 --> 00:10:30,230
at a home on a street outside the city,

196
00:10:30,230 --> 00:10:31,360
gunpowder ignited.

197
00:10:31,440 --> 00:10:32,750
The blast was far too powerful

198
00:10:32,750 --> 00:10:35,150
to have been caused
by ordinary gunpowder.

199
00:10:35,200 --> 00:10:36,930
Our preliminary assessment is

200
00:10:37,130 --> 00:10:40,590
that it was most likely Huliu explosive,
which is only kept in the palace.

201
00:10:40,590 --> 00:10:42,650
How much Huliu explosive is missing?

202
00:10:43,720 --> 00:10:45,780
How much Huliu explosive is missing?

203
00:10:48,320 --> 00:10:49,120
Eunuch Zheng,

204
00:10:49,280 --> 00:10:50,230
this inventory sheet

205
00:10:50,230 --> 00:10:51,200
is still being checked.

206
00:10:51,200 --> 00:10:52,850
Can you determine when it went missing?

207
00:10:52,850 --> 00:10:56,070
[Zhu Buhua, Chief Eunuch
of the Imperial Horse Bureau]

208
00:10:53,540 --> 00:10:55,200
If I knew when it went missing,

209
00:10:55,600 --> 00:10:56,400
what would I need you for?

210
00:10:56,400 --> 00:10:57,040
Shut up!

211
00:10:58,460 --> 00:10:59,110
Yes.

212
00:11:03,680 --> 00:11:04,480
Constable Wu,

213
00:11:05,210 --> 00:11:06,230
I'll have someone

214
00:11:06,470 --> 00:11:07,630
prepare a list of all eunuchs, officials,

215
00:11:07,630 --> 00:11:09,900
and craftsmen who entered or left

216
00:11:09,900 --> 00:11:11,680
the Imperial City in the past five days.

217
00:11:11,680 --> 00:11:12,550
Don't bother sleeping.

218
00:11:12,550 --> 00:11:13,800
Investigate through the night.

219
00:11:13,800 --> 00:11:14,630
Lord Zheng,

220
00:11:15,470 --> 00:11:17,300
should I investigate the people
or the missing items?

221
00:11:17,300 --> 00:11:19,760
You must investigate
the people, of course.

222
00:11:20,290 --> 00:11:21,640
But more importantly,

223
00:11:22,360 --> 00:11:24,160
you must uncover the plot

224
00:11:24,390 --> 00:11:26,720
behind the theft of the Huliu explosives.

225
00:11:28,670 --> 00:11:29,710
Yes, yes.

226
00:11:32,180 --> 00:11:34,010
Where is the Crown Prince's
imperial vessel now?

227
00:11:34,010 --> 00:11:34,810
Eunuch Zheng,

228
00:11:35,250 --> 00:11:36,350
the Crown Prince's imperial vessel

229
00:11:36,350 --> 00:11:39,550
should reach the Dongshuiguan Wharf
in about four hours.

230
00:11:39,930 --> 00:11:41,730
With the Huliu explosive stolen

231
00:11:43,600 --> 00:11:45,450
at such a critical moment,

232
00:11:48,730 --> 00:11:50,640
I pray

233
00:11:52,210 --> 00:11:53,630
the Crown Prince isn't the target.

234
00:11:53,630 --> 00:11:55,250
By order of the Crown Prince:

235
00:11:55,550 --> 00:11:58,290
accept the treasure ship offered
by Wang Ji, a merchant from Yangzhou.

236
00:11:58,290 --> 00:12:00,080
Canal transport is the lifeblood
of the state.

237
00:12:00,080 --> 00:12:02,440
The Crown Prince shall board this ship
to make this known to the realm.

238
00:12:01,590 --> 00:12:03,850
♪ The Golden Hall stands grand and wide ♪

239
00:12:02,630 --> 00:12:03,780
Change the boat.

240
00:12:03,870 --> 00:12:06,310
♪ Towers shrouded
deep in clouds and mist ♪

241
00:12:06,340 --> 00:12:08,580
♪ They call me the Crown Prince ♪

242
00:12:08,880 --> 00:12:11,190
♪ But I hide by the Qinhuai River ♪

243
00:12:16,260 --> 00:12:18,740
♪ Those high in court know
nothing of the world below ♪

244
00:12:18,770 --> 00:12:21,170
♪ The storms outside
are just tales to them ♪

245
00:12:21,200 --> 00:12:23,710
♪ Take off this robe,
and I'm just a stranger ♪

246
00:12:26,280 --> 00:12:30,740
♪ Across a thousand mountains, a thousand miles, I'll fight ♪

247
00:13:19,490 --> 00:13:20,290
Constable Wu?

248
00:13:21,680 --> 00:13:22,480
Constable Wu?

249
00:13:23,450 --> 00:13:24,250
Constable Wu.

250
00:13:25,430 --> 00:13:26,160
Eunuch Qing.

251
00:13:26,490 --> 00:13:27,470
So this is how you lot

252
00:13:27,470 --> 00:13:28,320
do your work?

253
00:13:28,680 --> 00:13:29,740
What a filthy mess!

254
00:13:29,970 --> 00:13:31,900
Thank you, thank you, Eunuch Qing.

255
00:13:36,860 --> 00:13:38,980
Ordinary craftsmen
and conscripted laborers

256
00:13:38,980 --> 00:13:41,160
are all thoroughly searched whenever
they enter or leave the Imperial City.

257
00:13:41,160 --> 00:13:43,580
The only people who can come and go freely
without being searched

258
00:13:43,580 --> 00:13:44,440
are officials.

259
00:13:44,800 --> 00:13:46,080
And among all the officials,

260
00:13:46,080 --> 00:13:47,230
only those four who travel by sedan chair

261
00:13:47,230 --> 00:13:48,680
could have smuggled out an entire barrel
of Huliu explosive.

262
00:13:48,680 --> 00:13:49,470
Eunuch Qing,

263
00:13:49,610 --> 00:13:50,930
we can't investigate the officials.

264
00:13:50,930 --> 00:13:51,500
Why not?

265
00:13:51,680 --> 00:13:53,500
Because we have no authority
to summon them for questioning.

266
00:13:53,500 --> 00:13:56,110
All we can do is investigate
their sedan chair bearers.

267
00:13:56,110 --> 00:13:58,090
Father, what good would that do?

268
00:13:58,380 --> 00:14:01,180
The bearers have most likely
already been bribed.

269
00:14:01,510 --> 00:14:02,490
Wouldn't an investigation

270
00:14:02,490 --> 00:14:03,680
just tip them off?

271
00:14:04,300 --> 00:14:05,110
If we're going to investigate anyone,

272
00:14:05,110 --> 00:14:06,960
it has to be those four officials.

273
00:14:06,960 --> 00:14:08,360
Investigate officials?

274
00:14:10,200 --> 00:14:11,230
Eunuch Qing knows the procedure.

275
00:14:11,230 --> 00:14:14,040
First, you gather evidence
from the outside,

276
00:14:14,180 --> 00:14:15,160
submit a sworn report,

277
00:14:15,160 --> 00:14:16,460
and then forward it
to the relevant government office.

278
00:14:16,460 --> 00:14:18,060
Its chief then decides
whether to refer the case

279
00:14:18,060 --> 00:14:21,520
to the Provincial Surveillance Commission
or the Censorate.

280
00:14:21,540 --> 00:14:22,270
Eunuch Qing,

281
00:14:22,800 --> 00:14:24,630
Lord Zheng has given me only 24 hours.

282
00:14:24,630 --> 00:14:25,440
Lord Zheng's business...

283
00:14:25,440 --> 00:14:27,330
I can't get involved
in Lord Zheng's business.

284
00:14:27,330 --> 00:14:29,110
I... I'm afraid I won't even have time

285
00:14:29,110 --> 00:14:30,370
to draft the memorial.

286
00:14:30,610 --> 00:14:31,160
Father,

287
00:14:31,820 --> 00:14:34,020
I know who we should investigate first.

288
00:14:34,420 --> 00:14:35,040
This man.

289
00:14:37,660 --> 00:14:39,160
[Guo Zhimin, Investigating Censor
of the Guangdong Circuit]

290
00:14:38,600 --> 00:14:39,230
Why him?

291
00:14:39,700 --> 00:14:40,360
This man...

292
00:14:40,900 --> 00:14:42,320
His home is the closest.

293
00:15:10,120 --> 00:15:12,420
[Guo Zhimin, Investigating Censor]

294
00:15:30,040 --> 00:15:31,060
The deceased is Guo Zhimin,

295
00:15:31,060 --> 00:15:32,190
a native of Yangzhou

296
00:15:32,200 --> 00:15:33,830
who served as an Investigating Censor
for the Guangdong Circuit.

297
00:15:33,830 --> 00:15:35,350
He only recently arrived in Jinling.

298
00:15:35,350 --> 00:15:36,800
He had two servants: a doorkeeper

299
00:15:36,800 --> 00:15:38,590
and a maid who did
the laundry and cooking.

300
00:15:38,590 --> 00:15:41,140
[Laoliu, Constable of Yingtian Prefecture]

301
00:15:38,700 --> 00:15:39,090
Oh,

302
00:15:39,180 --> 00:15:40,310
and he had a fiancée,

303
00:15:40,330 --> 00:15:41,810
but she didn't live with him.

304
00:15:41,810 --> 00:15:43,780
Last night, Guo Zhimin
went out to visit someone.

305
00:15:43,780 --> 00:15:45,080
He wasn't feeling well when he returned,

306
00:15:45,080 --> 00:15:45,830
so he took some medicine

307
00:15:45,830 --> 00:15:46,890
and retired early.

308
00:15:47,300 --> 00:15:49,210
When the earthquake struck, the doorkeeper
and the maid fled outside.

309
00:15:49,210 --> 00:15:50,340
When they returned,

310
00:15:50,640 --> 00:15:52,830
the maid was the first
to discover the body.

311
00:15:52,830 --> 00:15:53,750
In a panic,

312
00:15:54,000 --> 00:15:56,420
the doorkeeper immediately reported
the death to the authorities.

313
00:15:56,420 --> 00:16:03,240
♪ Though wronged by men,
I'll stand by what's right ♪

314
00:16:09,610 --> 00:16:10,940
The footprints have been examined.

315
00:16:10,940 --> 00:16:11,940
Only three people
left footprints: Guo Zhimin,

316
00:16:11,940 --> 00:16:13,600
the doorkeeper, and the maid.

317
00:16:14,740 --> 00:16:16,240
Judging by the scene,

318
00:16:16,630 --> 00:16:18,640
the bloodstains, the injuries,

319
00:16:19,280 --> 00:16:20,830
and the state of the body,

320
00:16:21,230 --> 00:16:22,350
it appears that Censor Guo died

321
00:16:22,350 --> 00:16:24,110
when the earthquake caused

322
00:16:24,760 --> 00:16:26,020
the house to collapse.

323
00:16:28,060 --> 00:16:29,340
Once the coroner
finishes the examination,

324
00:16:29,340 --> 00:16:31,270
we should be able to close the case.

325
00:16:33,210 --> 00:16:34,070
What a tragedy.

326
00:16:47,180 --> 00:16:49,730
[Su Jingxi]

327
00:16:51,290 --> 00:16:58,300
[One Hour Until the Crown Prince
Arrives in Jinling]

328
00:17:12,510 --> 00:17:13,339
Your Highness,

329
00:17:13,339 --> 00:17:13,980
the treasure ship

330
00:17:13,980 --> 00:17:16,640
will reach the Dongshuiguan Wharf
before noon.

331
00:17:18,250 --> 00:17:19,030
Once ashore,

332
00:17:19,250 --> 00:17:20,200
Lord Zheng He

333
00:17:20,290 --> 00:17:22,550
will personally escort Your Highness
back to the palace.

334
00:17:22,550 --> 00:17:23,599
After a brief rest,

335
00:17:23,599 --> 00:17:25,930
I'll send an order to relieve the victims.

336
00:17:32,460 --> 00:17:34,790
Tomorrow, at the auspicious hour selected
by the Imperial Astronomical Bureau,

337
00:17:34,790 --> 00:17:37,300
Your Highness will pay tribute to
the Hongwu Emperor at Xiaoling Mausoleum.

338
00:17:37,300 --> 00:17:38,780
The day after,

339
00:17:39,110 --> 00:17:41,570
Your Highness will receive the officials
at Fengtian Hall at 7:45 AM.

340
00:17:40,460 --> 00:17:43,120
[Wang Daban, Eunuch of the Eastern Palace]

341
00:17:41,900 --> 00:17:46,360
That afternoon, Your Highness will inspect
the disaster zone south of the city.

342
00:17:46,600 --> 00:17:47,380
Got it.

343
00:17:48,710 --> 00:17:50,910
We can discuss it after we reach Jinling

344
00:17:50,920 --> 00:17:52,090
and meet Sanbao.

345
00:17:53,010 --> 00:17:53,960
Anything else?

346
00:17:59,400 --> 00:18:00,270
Your Highness,

347
00:18:00,570 --> 00:18:03,570
Sai Zilong's wings
are half a finger's breadth apart.

348
00:18:03,620 --> 00:18:05,310
It's constantly fluttering its wings—

349
00:18:05,310 --> 00:18:06,400
ready to fight.

350
00:18:12,050 --> 00:18:12,940
Eunuch Wang,

351
00:18:13,860 --> 00:18:17,310
you're the only one aboard who understands
this little pleasure of mine.

352
00:18:17,310 --> 00:18:18,200
A pity

353
00:18:20,180 --> 00:18:21,710
that once we reach Jinling,

354
00:18:21,860 --> 00:18:23,570
I won't have the leisure for such things.

355
00:18:23,570 --> 00:18:26,500
Your Highness can make time
for it whenever you wish.

356
00:18:34,270 --> 00:18:35,230
Go on!

357
00:18:36,490 --> 00:18:37,350
Your Highness.

358
00:18:38,210 --> 00:18:38,860
Your Highness.

359
00:18:38,860 --> 00:18:40,060
Keep your voice down.

360
00:18:40,360 --> 00:18:41,560
All right, all right.

361
00:18:41,860 --> 00:18:42,720
Your Highness,

362
00:18:42,990 --> 00:18:45,490
shall we change
into your ceremonial robes first?

363
00:18:45,490 --> 00:18:46,420
What's the rush?

364
00:18:47,200 --> 00:18:48,120
One more round.

365
00:18:48,810 --> 00:18:50,270
All right, one more round.

366
00:18:50,840 --> 00:18:51,700
Your Highness,

367
00:18:52,120 --> 00:18:53,900
what's the fun
of watching crickets on this ship?

368
00:18:53,900 --> 00:18:55,250
They're just here to pass the time.

369
00:18:55,250 --> 00:18:56,510
Once we reach Jinling,

370
00:18:57,380 --> 00:18:58,550
we'll have Huajing crickets,

371
00:18:58,550 --> 00:18:59,710
Giant crickets,

372
00:19:00,070 --> 00:19:01,160
Huangling crickets—

373
00:19:01,160 --> 00:19:02,790
every kind of cricket you could want!

374
00:19:02,790 --> 00:19:04,050
Right, Your Highness?

375
00:19:04,180 --> 00:19:06,360
You'll get to watch
even better ones, Your Highness.

376
00:19:06,360 --> 00:19:07,690
Do you think I'm a child?

377
00:19:12,570 --> 00:19:13,030
Bite it!

378
00:19:13,250 --> 00:19:14,180
Come on, bite it!

379
00:19:22,290 --> 00:19:23,150
Your Highness.

380
00:19:25,270 --> 00:19:26,200
Your Highness.

381
00:19:30,250 --> 00:19:31,440
Your Highness.

382
00:19:34,750 --> 00:19:36,030
If you don't change now,

383
00:19:36,030 --> 00:19:37,230
we'll be late.

384
00:19:38,210 --> 00:19:40,140
All right, all right! I'll change!

385
00:19:40,680 --> 00:19:41,410
So annoying.

386
00:19:43,210 --> 00:19:44,670
Thank you, Your Highness.

387
00:19:45,210 --> 00:19:46,470
Where is my Sai Zilong?

388
00:19:46,760 --> 00:19:47,790
Stop fooling around!

389
00:19:47,790 --> 00:19:48,920
Yes, Your Highness.

390
00:19:55,010 --> 00:19:58,430
[Li Yong, Guard of the Eastern Palace]

391
00:20:06,770 --> 00:20:07,570
Constable Wu,

392
00:20:07,570 --> 00:20:08,890
there's news from the prefectural office.

393
00:20:08,890 --> 00:20:12,290
The Crown Prince's ship
has entered the Outer Qinhuai River.

394
00:20:14,360 --> 00:20:14,920
Fall in!

395
00:20:17,880 --> 00:20:19,710
The Crown Prince is coming to Jinling.

396
00:20:19,710 --> 00:20:21,090
From the Earl of Xiangcheng

397
00:20:21,090 --> 00:20:23,350
to the heads of every government office,

398
00:20:23,420 --> 00:20:25,350
all must go to Dongshuiguan Wharf
to welcome the Crown Prince.

399
00:20:25,350 --> 00:20:26,450
And after last night's earthquake,

400
00:20:26,450 --> 00:20:27,910
the city is still in chaos.

401
00:20:28,810 --> 00:20:31,970
The officials at the garrison yamen
have issued strict orders.

402
00:20:31,970 --> 00:20:33,900
Everyone listed on the duty roster

403
00:20:33,940 --> 00:20:36,620
must stand guard along the streets,
unless they're dead.

404
00:20:36,620 --> 00:20:38,530
Not even a mosquito is
to get through on the road

405
00:20:38,530 --> 00:20:40,790
from Dongshuiguan Wharf
to the Imperial City.

406
00:20:40,790 --> 00:20:41,520
Understood?

407
00:20:41,620 --> 00:20:42,530
Understood!

408
00:20:44,140 --> 00:20:44,710
Let's go.

409
00:20:44,810 --> 00:20:45,360
Move out!

410
00:20:45,600 --> 00:20:46,230
Hurry up!

411
00:20:46,990 --> 00:20:47,720
Wu Dingyuan,

412
00:20:47,850 --> 00:20:49,910
you're assigned to guard Shangutai.

413
00:20:52,300 --> 00:20:54,500
Shangutai? That's a cushy assignment.

414
00:20:54,620 --> 00:20:55,490
Sure is.

415
00:20:55,870 --> 00:20:56,730
At this hour, it's scorching hot

416
00:20:56,730 --> 00:20:58,930
at Shangutai. That good-for-nothing

417
00:20:59,050 --> 00:21:00,090
will melt in the sun.

418
00:21:00,090 --> 00:21:01,710
Constable Wu really doesn't seem

419
00:21:01,710 --> 00:21:02,780
to care about his own son.

420
00:21:02,780 --> 00:21:03,580
That's right.

421
00:21:04,510 --> 00:21:05,730
He's sending us to Dongshuiguan Wharf

422
00:21:05,730 --> 00:21:07,000
to welcome the Crown Prince
in grand style,

423
00:21:07,000 --> 00:21:08,510
while his own son has been assigned

424
00:21:08,510 --> 00:21:09,950
to the toughest post.

425
00:21:11,350 --> 00:21:12,480
What's he thinking?

426
00:21:12,770 --> 00:21:13,470
Who knows?

427
00:21:14,440 --> 00:21:15,440
Come on, let's go.

428
00:21:17,050 --> 00:21:18,510
Take your time eating, Wu.

429
00:21:19,620 --> 00:21:20,190
You...

430
00:21:22,160 --> 00:21:27,070
[One Hour Until the Crown Prince
Arrives in Jinling]

431
00:21:37,340 --> 00:21:41,250
♪ Those high in court know
nothing of the world below ♪

432
00:21:41,320 --> 00:21:45,320
♪ The storms outside  are just tales to them ♪

433
00:21:45,450 --> 00:21:49,460
♪ Take off this robe, and I'm just a stranger ♪

434
00:21:47,180 --> 00:21:48,040
Your Highness!

435
00:21:48,920 --> 00:21:49,750
Your Highness.

436
00:21:49,490 --> 00:21:54,930
♪ Whose life isn't hanging by a thread? ♪

437
00:21:50,250 --> 00:21:51,970
Please, stay away
from the side of the ship.

438
00:21:51,970 --> 00:21:53,210
If you fall overboard, I could

439
00:21:53,210 --> 00:21:57,070
never atone for such a grave offense,
even if I died a thousand deaths!

440
00:21:58,330 --> 00:21:58,920
Li Yong,

441
00:21:59,470 --> 00:22:01,140
this treasure ship displaces 1,500 tons.

442
00:22:01,140 --> 00:22:02,290
With no wind or waves,

443
00:22:02,290 --> 00:22:04,110
how could a mere river make it sway?

444
00:22:04,110 --> 00:22:05,340
I'm not trying to criticize you,

445
00:22:05,340 --> 00:22:07,000
but you really know so little!

446
00:22:07,530 --> 00:22:07,990
Yes.

447
00:22:08,230 --> 00:22:08,680
Yes.

448
00:22:09,060 --> 00:22:10,130
Where's my Sai Zilong?

449
00:22:10,130 --> 00:22:10,810
It's gone!

450
00:22:26,180 --> 00:22:27,550
When the ship reaches Dongshuiguan Wharf,

451
00:22:27,550 --> 00:22:29,040
use fireworks as the signal.

452
00:22:29,040 --> 00:22:30,700
Light the fuse upon seeing it.

453
00:22:51,030 --> 00:22:51,750
Li Yong.

454
00:22:53,010 --> 00:22:53,870
Your Highness!

455
00:22:55,100 --> 00:22:55,960
Your Highness.

456
00:22:56,230 --> 00:22:58,070
Are these fireworks along the way

457
00:22:58,070 --> 00:22:59,200
to welcome me?

458
00:23:00,770 --> 00:23:01,930
Your Highness is absolutely right.

459
00:23:01,930 --> 00:23:03,940
The prefectures and counties have prepared
them in accordance with court protocol.

460
00:23:03,940 --> 00:23:05,270
That must be the reason.

461
00:23:09,360 --> 00:23:11,300
From Yangzhou all the way to Jinling,

462
00:23:11,300 --> 00:23:13,430
there have been fireworks everywhere.

463
00:23:13,430 --> 00:23:16,290
Don't you think
that's an excessive waste of money?

464
00:23:16,550 --> 00:23:17,670
Your Highness's virtue

465
00:23:17,670 --> 00:23:18,670
is admired by all.

466
00:23:19,160 --> 00:23:20,010
The fireworks are merely

467
00:23:20,010 --> 00:23:22,670
a small token of their regard
for Your Highness.

468
00:23:32,970 --> 00:23:33,710
Is that so?

469
00:23:52,610 --> 00:23:56,890
[Dongshui Pass]

470
00:24:58,990 --> 00:24:59,850
Your Highness,

471
00:24:59,850 --> 00:25:01,640
now that you've caught it, hurry
and change into your ceremonial robes.

472
00:25:01,640 --> 00:25:03,700
We're almost at Dongshuiguan Wharf.

473
00:25:10,950 --> 00:25:12,410
You little rascal!

474
00:25:13,700 --> 00:25:14,710
Your Highness,

475
00:25:14,880 --> 00:25:16,940
everyone on shore is waiting for you!

476
00:26:35,850 --> 00:26:36,660
Lord Li,

477
00:26:37,230 --> 00:26:39,480
it's not the Crown Prince's
imperial vessel, is it?

478
00:26:37,470 --> 00:26:40,870
[Defense Earl of Xiangcheng, Li Long]

479
00:26:39,850 --> 00:26:40,590
Lord Zheng,

480
00:26:40,680 --> 00:26:41,790
we just learned

481
00:26:42,380 --> 00:26:44,140
that His Highness transferred

482
00:26:44,200 --> 00:26:46,770
to a treasure ship in Yangzhou,
gifted by Wang Ji, a merchant.

483
00:26:46,770 --> 00:26:48,460
A ship gifted by a merchant?

484
00:26:49,250 --> 00:26:51,380
Where are His Highness's attendants?

485
00:26:51,510 --> 00:26:53,430
How could they allow the Crown Prince
to so flagrantly

486
00:26:53,430 --> 00:26:55,630
overstep the prescribed rules of rank?

487
00:27:00,070 --> 00:27:00,930
Your Highness,

488
00:27:01,180 --> 00:27:02,780
everyone's waiting for you.

489
00:27:02,820 --> 00:27:04,260
If they don't want to wait,

490
00:27:04,260 --> 00:27:05,310
they can leave.

491
00:27:05,510 --> 00:27:06,440
Besides,

492
00:27:06,820 --> 00:27:08,100
let them wait if they want to.

493
00:27:08,100 --> 00:27:09,190
What's the rush?

494
00:29:32,350 --> 00:29:33,380
Run!

495
00:29:42,190 --> 00:29:43,060
Your Highness!

496
00:29:43,290 --> 00:29:44,380
My Lord! My Lord!

497
00:35:11,720 --> 00:35:12,400
Go on, run!

498
00:35:20,490 --> 00:35:21,750
You little scoundrel!

499
00:35:26,380 --> 00:35:27,040
Go on, run!

500
00:35:28,110 --> 00:35:29,640
Aren't you good at running?

501
00:35:47,570 --> 00:35:48,240
Envoy,

502
00:35:48,630 --> 00:35:53,490
[Lord of Iron Alliance Yesterday Ye He]

503
00:35:49,650 --> 00:35:51,400
the nobleman above us has ordered us

504
00:35:51,400 --> 00:35:53,460
to kill the Crown Prince at all costs.

505
00:35:53,770 --> 00:35:58,510
[Iron Alliance He Si]

506
00:35:54,380 --> 00:35:55,300
But after that explosion,

507
00:35:55,300 --> 00:35:56,050
everything's in chaos.

508
00:35:56,050 --> 00:35:57,380
We can't tell who's who.

509
00:35:58,070 --> 00:35:59,440
How are we supposed to know
which one is the Crown Prince

510
00:35:59,440 --> 00:36:00,340
and which one isn't?

511
00:36:00,340 --> 00:36:00,950
Shut up.

512
00:36:03,390 --> 00:36:05,770
Send 12 men downstream to hunt him down.

513
00:36:06,210 --> 00:36:08,270
The Crown Prince must die in Jinling.

514
00:36:08,630 --> 00:36:09,150
Yes!

515
00:36:09,820 --> 00:36:10,420
Come back.

516
00:36:11,920 --> 00:36:13,400
Find a few more sharp men

517
00:36:13,800 --> 00:36:15,990
and send them to search Shangutai,

518
00:36:15,990 --> 00:36:18,590
Zhuquehang, and Taoyedu,
all downstream from Dongshuiguan.

519
00:36:18,590 --> 00:36:19,070
Yes.

520
00:36:28,470 --> 00:36:29,270
Hold on tight.

521
00:37:07,610 --> 00:37:08,360
Lord Zheng.

522
00:37:10,450 --> 00:37:11,110
Lord Zheng.

523
00:37:13,030 --> 00:37:14,110
Why are you so late?

524
00:37:14,230 --> 00:37:15,650
It all happened so suddenly.

525
00:37:15,650 --> 00:37:16,280
Tell me,

526
00:37:16,620 --> 00:37:17,560
was the ship

527
00:37:18,070 --> 00:37:19,360
blown up

528
00:37:19,530 --> 00:37:22,320
with Huliu explosive, the same kind
stolen from the palace?

529
00:37:22,320 --> 00:37:23,050
Yes.

530
00:37:23,780 --> 00:37:25,800
But the Huliu explosive stolen
from the palace

531
00:37:25,800 --> 00:37:27,170
was only stolen 5 days ago.

532
00:37:27,170 --> 00:37:28,350
How could anyone have had time

533
00:37:28,350 --> 00:37:31,210
to hide it aboard
the Crown Prince's treasure ship?

534
00:37:35,000 --> 00:37:36,000
Then tell me,

535
00:37:37,120 --> 00:37:39,490
who exactly blew up
the Crown Prince's ship?

536
00:37:39,490 --> 00:37:40,980
Where did the Huliu explosive
come from,

537
00:37:40,980 --> 00:37:43,530
and how did it end up
aboard the Crown Prince's ship?

538
00:37:43,530 --> 00:37:44,360
Well, I...

539
00:37:44,880 --> 00:37:46,210
I'm not sure about that.

540
00:37:47,670 --> 00:37:49,630
I asked you to investigate
the Huliu explosive case.

541
00:37:49,630 --> 00:37:51,190
What have you found out?

542
00:37:51,530 --> 00:37:52,670
L-Lord Zheng,

543
00:37:52,990 --> 00:37:54,620
the culprit has been one step

544
00:37:55,030 --> 00:37:56,780
ahead of us in both the bombing

545
00:37:57,130 --> 00:37:58,720
at that house and Lord Guo Zhimin's death.

546
00:37:58,720 --> 00:37:59,970
Every time we get a lead, it goes cold.

547
00:37:59,970 --> 00:38:00,670
Shut up!

548
00:38:03,190 --> 00:38:05,050
It's too late to say anything now.

549
00:38:05,610 --> 00:38:07,270
I-I'll go investigate again.

550
00:38:08,160 --> 00:38:10,360
We'll just have to wait to be impeached.

551
00:38:17,440 --> 00:38:18,590
You scoundrel.

552
00:38:19,760 --> 00:38:21,240
Did you know in advance that the ship

553
00:38:21,240 --> 00:38:22,240
would be blown up?

554
00:39:32,130 --> 00:39:32,840
Sirs,

555
00:39:34,170 --> 00:39:35,800
this is the scoundrel I caught.

556
00:39:35,800 --> 00:39:38,600
He was about to be sent to
the Yingtian Prefecture.

557
00:39:38,810 --> 00:39:40,940
I'd appreciate it if you'd let us pass.

558
00:39:41,110 --> 00:39:42,240
Are you the constable

559
00:39:42,240 --> 00:39:43,740
The constable on duty

560
00:39:44,070 --> 00:39:44,670
Yes, I am.

561
00:39:45,450 --> 00:39:47,250
Why are you in such a sorry state?

562
00:39:49,030 --> 00:39:50,390
I figured I could turn him

563
00:39:50,390 --> 00:39:52,690
in and collect a reward.

564
00:39:53,340 --> 00:39:54,760
I didn't expect the scoundrel

565
00:39:54,760 --> 00:39:55,920
to know a thing or two about fighting.

566
00:39:55,920 --> 00:39:58,050
He ended up dragging me into the river.

567
00:39:58,330 --> 00:39:59,190
What rotten luck.

568
00:39:59,190 --> 00:40:00,310
It sure is.

569
00:40:00,880 --> 00:40:02,470
Do you need our help?

570
00:40:49,940 --> 00:40:51,080
Give me your wine.

571
00:40:52,210 --> 00:40:53,000
I saved you,

572
00:40:54,540 --> 00:40:55,800
so you should thank me.

573
00:41:46,410 --> 00:41:47,110
Tell me,

574
00:41:48,050 --> 00:41:49,320
how did you figure out

575
00:41:49,660 --> 00:41:51,660
those two soldiers were impostors?

576
00:42:02,360 --> 00:42:03,090
Their boots.

577
00:42:04,580 --> 00:42:05,620
Soldiers on duty

578
00:42:06,630 --> 00:42:08,430
wouldn't wear brand-new boots.

579
00:42:08,520 --> 00:42:10,050
They'd give them blisters.

580
00:42:13,030 --> 00:42:14,160
You know quite a bit,

581
00:42:14,800 --> 00:42:16,860
and you're pretty skilled in combat.

582
00:42:17,110 --> 00:42:20,170
You're a military officer
serving the Crown Prince, aren't you?

583
00:42:20,170 --> 00:42:21,300
Who are you, really?

584
00:42:26,910 --> 00:42:29,020
I'm asking you. Who are you?

585
00:42:33,430 --> 00:42:34,360
Don't follow me.

586
00:42:58,950 --> 00:43:01,610
So that's why you were
giving me such a hard time.

587
00:43:02,710 --> 00:43:04,170
You've got quite a temper.

588
00:43:04,760 --> 00:43:05,950
All your moves are dirty tricks.
